---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/page-layout.astro";
import { churchInfo } from "@/lib/church-data";

const salvationContactHref = `mailto:${churchInfo.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(
  "I have a question about salvation"
)}`;
---

<PageLayout
  title="What Does It Mean To Be Saved?"
  description="The Bible way to heaven — how to know you have eternal life through Jesus Christ."
>
  <div class="salvation-page">
    <div class="reading-progress" data-reading-progress aria-hidden="true">
    </div>

    <section class="salvation-hero" aria-labelledby="salvation-title">
      <div class="hero-radiance" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero-lines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero-cross" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="salvation-shell hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="hero-eyebrow">
            <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
            The Bible Way to Heaven
          </p>
          <h1 id="salvation-title">You can <em>know.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-intro">
            Every person eventually asks questions like these:
          </p>
          <ul class="hero-questions" role="list">
            <li>What happens after I die?</li>
            <li>Can I know that I will spend eternity with God?</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="hero-answer">
            The Bible says we can know. God does not want us to live in
            uncertainty. He wants us to know the way of salvation.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a
              class="salvation-button salvation-button--light"
              href="#our-need"
            >
              Read the Bible’s answer
              <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="m5 12 14 0m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a
              class="salvation-button salvation-button--outline"
              href={salvationContactHref}
            >
              Talk with someone
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="hero-scripture">
          <div class="scripture-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
          <p>
            These things have I written unto you that believe on the name of the
            Son of God; that ye may know that ye have eternal life…
          </p>
          <footer>
            <cite>1 John 5:13</cite>
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <a class="hero-scroll-cue" href="#message-map">
        <span>Follow the message</span>
        <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </section>

    <nav
      id="message-map"
      class="message-map"
      aria-label="The message of salvation"
    >
      <ol class="salvation-shell">
        <li>
          <a href="#our-need">
            <span class="map-number">01</span>
            <span class="map-copy">
              <strong>Our Need</strong>
              <small>Sin separates</small>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="#gods-gift">
            <span class="map-number">02</span>
            <span class="map-copy">
              <strong>God’s Gift</strong>
              <small>Christ saves</small>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="#your-response">
            <span class="map-number">03</span>
            <span class="map-copy">
              <strong>Your Response</strong>
              <small>Trust Christ</small>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="#questions">
            <span class="map-number">04</span>
            <span class="map-copy">
              <strong>Let’s Talk</strong>
              <small>We are here</small>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <section id="our-need" class="story-section story-section--need">
      <div class="salvation-shell story-grid">
        <header class="story-heading">
          <p class="section-eyebrow"><span>01</span> Our Need</p>
          <h2>The problem we cannot solve ourselves.</h2>
          <p>
            Before someone can be saved, they must first admit they are lost in
            sin.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="story-copy">
          <div class="story-block">
            <h3>Sin separates us from God.</h3>
            <blockquote class="verse-card verse-card--simple">
              <p>For all have sinned, and come short of the glory of God.</p>
              <footer><cite>Romans 3:23</cite></footer>
            </blockquote>
            <p>
              Since Adam and Eve, sin has affected every person. Sin is anything
              contrary to God’s holiness, and our sin separates us from Him.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="verse-card verse-card--dark">
              <span class="verse-label">The consequence—and the promise</span>
              <p>
                For the wages of sin is death; but the gift of God is eternal
                life through Jesus Christ our Lord.
              </p>
              <footer><cite>Romans 6:23</cite></footer>
            </blockquote>
            <p>
              The penalty for sin is spiritual death and eternal separation from
              God.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="story-divider" aria-hidden="true">
            <span></span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 3v18M7 8h10"></path>
            </svg>
            <span></span>
          </div>

          <div class="story-block">
            <h3>Good works and religion cannot save us.</h3>
            <p>
              People often try to reach God through religion, effort, or
              morality. But none of those can remove sin.
            </p>

            <div class="verse-pair">
              <blockquote class="verse-card verse-card--quiet">
                <p>
                  There is a way which seemeth right unto a man, but the end
                  thereof are the ways of death.
                </p>
                <footer><cite>Proverbs 14:12</cite></footer>
              </blockquote>

              <blockquote class="verse-card verse-card--gold">
                <p>
                  For by grace are ye saved through faith; and that not of
                  yourselves: it is the gift of God: Not of works, lest any man
                  should boast.
                </p>
                <footer><cite>Ephesians 2:8–9</cite></footer>
              </blockquote>
            </div>

            <p class="story-conclusion">
              Salvation is not something we earn. <strong
                >It is a gift God gives.</strong
              >
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      id="gods-gift"
      class="turning-point"
      aria-labelledby="turning-title"
    >
      <div class="turning-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="salvation-shell turning-content">
        <p class="section-eyebrow section-eyebrow--light">
          <span>02</span> God’s Answer
        </p>
        <h2 id="turning-title">But God.</h2>
        <p>
          The story of salvation does not end with what we have done. It turns
          on what God has done for us through His Son.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="answer-section" aria-labelledby="answer-title">
      <div class="salvation-shell answer-shell">
        <header class="answer-heading">
          <p class="answer-kicker">
            Though we were separated from God, He loved us.
          </p>
          <h2 id="answer-title">Jesus Christ paid the price for our sin.</h2>
        </header>

        <blockquote class="john-card">
          <footer class="john-reference">
            <cite>John <strong>3:16</strong></cite>
          </footer>
          <p>
            For God so loved the world, that he gave his only begotten Son, that
            whosoever believeth in him should not perish, but have everlasting
            life.
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <div
          class="gospel-facts"
          aria-label="The death and resurrection of Jesus Christ"
        >
          <article>
            <span>At the cross</span>
            <h3>Jesus died for our sins.</h3>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>Three days later</span>
            <h3>Jesus rose again.</h3>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="answer-finish">
          <p>
            Through His death and resurrection, He paid the debt we could never
            pay ourselves.
          </p>
          <blockquote class="romans-card">
            <p>
              But God commendeth his love toward us, in that, while we were yet
              sinners, Christ died for us.
            </p>
            <footer><cite>Romans 5:8</cite></footer>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      id="your-response"
      class="response-section"
      aria-labelledby="response-title"
    >
      <div class="response-rings" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="salvation-shell response-grid">
        <header class="story-heading response-heading">
          <p class="section-eyebrow"><span>03</span> Your Response</p>
          <h2 id="response-title">Trust Jesus Christ alone.</h2>
          <p>Salvation is received by faith—not achieved by effort.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="response-copy">
          <p class="response-lead">
            To be saved, we must stop trusting ourselves, our works, or our
            religion, and place our faith in Jesus Christ alone for forgiveness
            and eternal life.
          </p>

          <blockquote class="call-verse">
            <span class="verse-label">God’s invitation</span>
            <p>
              For whosoever shall call upon the name of the Lord shall be saved.
            </p>
            <footer><cite>Romans 10:13</cite></footer>
          </blockquote>

          <p>
            If you are ready to turn to Christ, you can call on Him in faith and
            ask Him to save you.
          </p>

          <aside class="prayer-card" aria-labelledby="prayer-title">
            <div class="prayer-heading">
              <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <p>A Prayer of Faith</p>
              <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="prayer-title">Calling on the Lord</h3>
            <p class="prayer-note">
              A prayer is not a formula. Salvation is by grace through faith in
              Jesus Christ. If you are ready to call on Him in faith, you may
              pray something like this:
            </p>
            <blockquote>
              <p>
                Dear God, I know that I am separated from you because of sin. I
                confess that in my sin, I cannot save myself. Right now, I turn
                to you alone to be my Saviour. I ask you to save me from the
                penalty of my sin, and I trust you to provide eternal life to
                me.
              </p>
              <footer>— Amen</footer>
            </blockquote>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      id="questions"
      class="questions-section"
      aria-labelledby="questions-title"
    >
      <div class="questions-light" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="salvation-shell questions-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-eyebrow section-eyebrow--light">
            <span>04</span> We Are Here
          </p>
          <h2 id="questions-title">Do you have questions?</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="questions-copy">
          <p>
            If you would like to talk with someone about salvation or about
            having a relationship with God, we would love to help. If you
            trusted Christ today, we would love to hear from you, too.
          </p>
          <div class="questions-actions">
            <a
              class="salvation-button salvation-button--cta"
              href={salvationContactHref}
            >
              Talk with someone about salvation
              <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="m5 12 14 0m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a
              class="salvation-button salvation-button--outline"
              href="/visit/"
            >
              Visit Victory Baptist Church
            </a>
          </div>
          <a class="questions-email" href={`mailto:${churchInfo.email}`}>
            {churchInfo.email}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<script>
  const progressBar = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(
    "[data-reading-progress]"
  );
  let animationFrame = 0;

  const updateReadingProgress = () => {
    const scrollableHeight =
      document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
    const progress =
      scrollableHeight > 0 ? window.scrollY / scrollableHeight : 0;
    const boundedProgress = Math.min(Math.max(progress, 0), 1);

    progressBar?.style.setProperty("transform", `scaleX(${boundedProgress})`);
    animationFrame = 0;
  };

  const requestProgressUpdate = () => {
    if (animationFrame === 0) {
      animationFrame = window.requestAnimationFrame(updateReadingProgress);
    }
  };

  window.addEventListener("scroll", requestProgressUpdate, { passive: true });
  window.addEventListener("resize", requestProgressUpdate, { passive: true });
  updateReadingProgress();
</script>

<style>
  .salvation-page {
    --salvation-navy: #081b31;
    --salvation-navy-soft: #102b4a;
    --salvation-cream: #fbf8f1;
    --salvation-paper: #fffdf8;
    --salvation-gold: #c9973f;
    --salvation-gold-dark: #855f20;
    --salvation-gold-light: #f4d58d;
    --salvation-ink: #1f2933;
    --salvation-copy: #53606c;
    --salvation-line: rgba(8, 27, 49, 0.13);

    overflow: clip;
    color: var(--salvation-ink);
    background: var(--salvation-paper);
  }

  .reading-progress {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 60;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--salvation-gold-light),
      var(--salvation-gold)
    );
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left center;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .salvation-shell {
    width: min(calc(100% - 2.5rem), 74rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .salvation-hero {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    display: flex;
    min-height: calc(100svh - 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem) clamp(6rem, 10vw, 8rem);
    color: #fff;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 78% 48%,
        rgba(51, 124, 185, 0.24),
        transparent 29rem
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 12% 4%,
        rgba(201, 151, 63, 0.14),
        transparent 26rem
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #061426 0%,
        var(--salvation-navy) 48%,
        #0d2949 100%
      );
  }

  .hero-radiance {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -12rem;
    z-index: -2;
    width: min(56rem, 70vw);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.17) 0%,
      rgba(49, 128, 194, 0.09) 37%,
      transparent 68%
    );
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .hero-lines {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -3;
    opacity: 0.09;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 5rem 5rem;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 35%, #000);
  }

  .hero-cross {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 14rem);
    z-index: -1;
    width: 0.13rem;
    height: min(29rem, 48vw);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent,
      rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.5) 20%,
      rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.8) 72%,
      transparent
    );
    box-shadow: 0 0 4rem rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.18);
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .hero-cross span {
    position: absolute;
    top: 30%;
    left: 50%;
    width: min(13rem, 22vw);
    height: 0.13rem;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent,
      rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.75) 22%,
      rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.75) 78%,
      transparent
    );
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 43rem;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow,
  .section-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--salvation-gold-dark);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    color: var(--salvation-gold-light);
    animation: hero-rise 0.75s 0.05s both cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .hero-eyebrow > span {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
  }

  .hero-copy h1 {
    max-width: 8ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 8.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    text-wrap: balance;
    animation: hero-rise 0.85s 0.14s both cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .hero-copy h1 em {
    display: block;
    color: var(--salvation-gold-light);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    animation: hero-rise 0.8s 0.24s both cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .hero-questions {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.18rem, 2vw, 1.45rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    list-style: none;
    animation: hero-rise 0.8s 0.31s both cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .hero-questions li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .hero-questions li::before {
    color: var(--salvation-gold-light);
    content: "—";
  }

  .hero-answer {
    max-width: 39rem;
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    text-wrap: pretty;
    animation: hero-rise 0.8s 0.38s both cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .hero-actions,
  .questions-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    animation: hero-rise 0.8s 0.46s both cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .salvation-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 3.25rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.25;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color 180ms ease,
      border-color 180ms ease,
      color 180ms ease,
      transform 180ms ease,
      opacity 180ms ease;
  }

  .salvation-button:active {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .salvation-button:focus-visible,
  .message-map a:focus-visible,
  .hero-scroll-cue:focus-visible,
  .questions-email:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--salvation-gold-light);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .salvation-button svg {
    width: 1.15rem;
    height: 1.15rem;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }

  .salvation-button--light {
    color: var(--salvation-navy);
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0.8rem 2.5rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .salvation-button--outline {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
    color: #fff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .salvation-button--cta {
    color: var(--cta-foreground);
    background: var(--cta);
    box-shadow: 0 1rem 2.5rem rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.2);
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .salvation-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .salvation-button--light:hover {
      background: var(--salvation-gold-light);
    }

    .salvation-button--outline:hover {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .salvation-button--cta:hover {
      background: #12813c;
    }
  }

  .hero-scripture {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 31rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      145deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035)
    );
    box-shadow: 0 2rem 5rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.8rem);
    backdrop-filter: blur(0.8rem);
    animation: hero-card 1s 0.28s both cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .hero-scripture::after {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent,
      var(--salvation-gold-light),
      transparent
    );
    content: "";
  }

  .scripture-mark {
    height: 3.2rem;
    color: var(--salvation-gold-light);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .hero-scripture > p {
    margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.15rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.48;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .hero-scripture footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  }

  .hero-scripture cite,
  .verse-card cite,
  .john-reference,
  .romans-card cite,
  .call-verse cite {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero-scripture cite {
    color: var(--salvation-gold-light);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .hero-scripture footer span {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero-scroll-cue {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1.6rem;
    left: 50%;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .hero-scroll-cue svg {
    width: 1rem;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
